WEBVTT

00:24:59.250 --> 00:25:01.476
that leap of faith in which they existed,

00:25:01.500 --> 00:25:05.726
they do enter what Ricœur
often calls the "secondary naïveté".

00:25:05.750 --> 00:25:07.601
You trust with your eyes open

00:25:07.625 --> 00:25:11.434
and you wait, you just
don't do like this anymore,

00:25:11.458 --> 00:25:13.559
and think everything is fine,

00:25:13.583 --> 00:25:16.934
and that demands new experiences,

00:25:16.958 --> 00:25:20.434
generative experiences
that will create new layers of cells

00:25:20.458 --> 00:25:24.643
that are going to sit on the ones
that really need to die and evacuate.

00:25:24.667 --> 00:25:27.292
AG: How's that different
from trust, but verify.

00:25:29.250 --> 00:25:30.518
EP: Just the same.